ion-Language Models Act Through a Body?\n\nA VLM can spot the sofa in a second. But can it get a body there and sit down?\n\nWe call it Action Intelligence, and our work decouples it from motor control so it can finally be measured. Today’s best models turn out to be surprisingly bad at it. 🔻https://human-claw.github.io/","raw_text":{"text":"🦾HumanCLAW: Can Vision-Language Models Act Through a Body?\n\nA VLM can spot the sofa in a second. But can it get a body there and sit down?\n\nWe call it Action Intelligence, and our work decouples it from motor control so it can finally be measured. Today’s best models turn out to be surprisingly bad at it. 🔻https://t.co/9RDY1RO14q","display_text_range":[0,333],"facets":[{"type":"bold","indices":[2,11]},{"type":"bold","indices":[152,171]},{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2083208962430877696","display":"pic.x.com/ZxF00gTOcc","original":"https://t.co/ZxF00gTOcc","replacement":"https://x.com/Kuvvius/status/2083218879833362518/photo/1"},{"type":"url","indices":[308,331],"original":"https://t.co/9RDY1RO14q","replacement":"https://human-claw.github.io/","display":"human-claw.github.io"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Kuvvius","url":"https://x.com/Kuvvius","id":"1635560727284191232","followers":609,"following":345,"likes":262,"media_count":78,"name":"Jiawei Gu","description":"","raw_description":{"text":"","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1635560727284191232/1762432134","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046841522637922304/td5r5aEP_200x200.jpg","joined":"Tue Mar 14 08:37:49 +0000 2023","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=7p8yEHAAAAAJ&hl=En","display_url":"scholar.google.com/citations?user…"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":3,"retweets":20,"likes":85,"bookmarks":65,"quotes":3,"created_at":"Fri Jul 31 15:50:59 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1785513059,"poss